demo live, start to finish, and answering your questions as I go. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46254877/bc1cb0b5445584f3ae104cc332fb1100dbe0c569.png What you'll see on stream: A song becoming a level Every weapon on its own rhythm. Crits on the beat. 2 bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:25:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694424","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996850-1846651706693939","game_id":"steam-4996850","kind":"announcement","title":"Beatlash Free Demo + Livestream Live Now (Steam Next Fest)","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46254877/4d4a96a4d6f84c83cee626b4b607a9ab321c7b18.png The free demo is live for Steam Next Fest! Beatlash: Survival is a horde survivor where everything runs on the beat of the music. Weapons auto-fire in rhythm, enemies spawn on the downbeat, and a perfectly timed hit crits for double. Play the free demo now, Oct 19-26. Click Play Demo on our store page. What you'll find in the demo Weapons that fire on different parts of the bar, so stacking them is a build puzzle Enemy wave","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:48:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693939","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996850-1844115010503572","game_id":"steam-4996850","kind":"announcement","title":"A horde survivor that plays your music","summary":"it's a horde survivor. You know the genre, walk, the horde comes, you pick upgrades, you get stupidly strong. Here's the twist. Weapons don't have a fire rate, they fire on the beat of the music. Enemies spawn on the downbeat and move in rhythm. Hit an ability within the beat and it crits for double. Its a horde survivor that plays your music.If that's your kind of thing, wishlisting now genuinely helps.Thanks for reading this far. More devlogs coming roughly every 2 weeks between now and launch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T08:52:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503572","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4996850-1842212951305228","game_id":"steam-4996850","kind":"announcement","title":"The Beatlash demo is out!","summary":"The demo is live. it is about 30 minutes long. It has a campaign and also has a feature to import your own MP3 and the beat engine builds the fight out of it.Every weapon in Beatlash auto fires. Hit SPACE in time and your attacks crits for double.What is in the demo: 1. A practice round that teaches the beat safely 2. Round 1: City Ruins, two bosses 3. 7 weapons and 20+ upgrades 4. Import your own music, unlimited tracksHeadphones strongly recommended. It is a music game.If you like it, a wishli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T08:55:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4996850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4996850":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4996850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z"},"5162440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:02:05Z","status":"ok","error_co